WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.821 --> 00:00:16.290
By time Jimmy Bean reached Aunt Polly's house, he was out of breath.

2
00:00:18.211 --> 00:00:20.492
He was also still clutching a gardening tool.

3
00:00:20.512 --> 00:00:24.435
"I can't bring this inside!"

4
00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:28.178
he thought, hiding the tool behind a bush in Aunt Polly's garden.

5
00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:31.340
Then he boldly knocked on the front door.

6
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.962
"I need to see Miss Polly right away," he said to Nancy when she opened the door.

7
00:00:36.982 --> 00:00:38.462
"It's urgent."

8
00:00:41.023 --> 00:00:43.564
Nancy found Aunt Polly in her room, writing a letter.

9
00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:48.466
"Jimmy Bean is here, and he wants to talk to you, ma'am.

10
00:00:49.427 --> 00:00:50.627
He says it's important."

11
00:00:50.647 --> 00:00:55.429
"Me?" Aunt Polly was clearly surprised.

12
00:00:55.449 --> 00:00:59.050
"Are you sure he didn't mean Miss Pollyanna?

13
00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:02.592
He may see her for a few minutes, if he likes."

14
00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:08.503
"Yes, ma'am, but he insists you're the one he needs to talk to."

15
00:01:08.523 --> 00:01:12.326
"Very well, I'll come downstairs."

16
00:01:14.027 --> 00:01:17.250
Aunt Polly put the letter in an envelope and rose from her chair.

17
00:01:19.571 --> 00:01:23.334
In the sitting room, she found Jimmy, who started speaking at once.

18
00:01:24.535 --> 00:01:27.377
"Ma'am, I suppose you'll think what I'm saying is dreadful.

19
00:01:27.677 --> 00:01:30.900
But I'm doing it for Pollyanna, so I hope you won't be offended.

20
00:01:32.536 --> 00:01:37.339
I'd do anything for Pollyanna—and you would too, if you thought there was a chance she could walk

21
00:01:37.399 --> 00:01:41.541
again. I guess it's pride that's keeping you from asking Dr.

22
00:01:41.581 --> 00:01:42.422
Chilton to come."

23
00:01:43.762 --> 00:01:48.505
"What?" Aunt Polly's look of confusion quickly changed to outrage.

24
00:01:50.566 --> 00:01:51.427
Jimmy sighed.

25
00:01:51.447 --> 00:01:53.828
"I don't mean to make you angry.

26
00:01:55.069 --> 00:01:58.550
That's why I thought I'd begin by telling you about Pollyanna's walking again.

27
00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:01.052
I thought you'd listen to that."

28
00:02:02.948 --> 00:02:04.949
"Jimmy, what are you talking about?

29
00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:11.013
Start your story at the beginning, and be sure I understand everything before you continue."

30
00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:13.174
"All right."

31
00:02:13.954 --> 00:02:15.855
Jimmy wet his lips and started again.

32
00:02:15.875 --> 00:02:17.496
"First Dr.

33
00:02:17.536 --> 00:02:18.737
Chilton came to see Mr.

34
00:02:18.777 --> 00:02:21.198
Pendleton, and they talked in the library.

35
00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:24.460
Do you understand that?"

36
00:02:26.201 --> 00:02:26.902
"Yes, Jimmy."

37
00:02:27.362 --> 00:02:29.163
Aunt Polly's voice was rather faint.

38
00:02:29.183 --> 00:02:30.804
"Go on."

39
00:02:32.912 --> 00:02:36.795
"Well, the window was open, and I was weeding the flowerbed underneath.

40
00:02:37.836 --> 00:02:42.979
So it was easy for me to hear what they were saying about—" "You mean you were eavesdropping?

41
00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:48.423
Oh, Jimmy, you should never sneak around, trying to overhear conversations!"

42
00:02:49.884 --> 00:02:53.267
Jimmy put his hands on his hips and stuck his chin out defiantly.

43
00:02:53.287 --> 00:02:57.009
"I wasn't sneaking around, and I'm glad I listened.

44
00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:00.072
And you will be too, when I tell you what I heard.

45
00:03:01.048 --> 00:03:03.729
They were talking about Pollyanna walking again!"

46
00:03:03.749 --> 00:03:05.869
"What do you mean?"

47
00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:10.631
Aunt Polly leaned forward, eager to hear the rest of Jimmy's story.

48
00:03:10.651 --> 00:03:16.172
"Dr. Chilton knows some doctor somewhere that he thinks can cure Pollyanna.

49
00:03:17.393 --> 00:03:19.773
Dr. Chilton needs to see her first, to be sure.

50
00:03:19.793 --> 00:03:22.214
But he told Mr.

51
00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:24.495
Pendleton you wouldn't let him in the house."

52
00:03:25.815 --> 00:03:29.056
"Oh, Jimmy, I couldn't I can't!"

53
00:03:30.204 --> 00:03:32.646
Aunt Polly was wringing her hands helplessly.

54
00:03:32.666 --> 00:03:38.211
"I mean, I don't know—" "Exactly!"

55
00:03:38.612 --> 00:03:40.333
Jimmy said with a look of triumph.

56
00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:44.197
"That's why I'm here, so you will know what's going on.

57
00:03:45.358 --> 00:03:48.340
I'm not sure I have this right, but Dr.

58
00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:49.902
Chilton said he'd offend Dr.

59
00:03:49.942 --> 00:03:51.984
Warren if he came here without your permission.

60
00:03:53.145 --> 00:03:56.368
And he wished somebody could make you understand how important this is.

61
00:03:57.612 --> 00:03:58.453
But neither Dr.

62
00:03:58.493 --> 00:03:59.413
Chilton nor Mr.

63
00:03:59.453 --> 00:04:01.494
Pendleton knew anybody who could do that.

64
00:04:01.514 --> 00:04:04.696
That's why I decided to do it."

65
00:04:07.558 --> 00:04:08.838
Jimmy took a deep breath.

66
00:04:08.858 --> 00:04:11.500
"So, have I made you understand?"

67
00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.663
"Yes, Jimmy, but who is this doctor?

68
00:04:17.743 --> 00:04:18.243
Is Dr.

69
00:04:18.303 --> 00:04:21.425
Chilton sure this man could make Pollyanna walk?"

70
00:04:21.445 --> 00:04:26.408
"All I know is he cured someone just like Pollyanna.

71
00:04:27.676 --> 00:04:28.276
Anyway, Dr.

72
00:04:28.296 --> 00:04:30.177
Chilton didn't seem worried about the doctor.

73
00:04:30.638 --> 00:04:32.179
You're the real problem.

74
00:04:33.219 --> 00:04:35.720
I mean, now do you understand why Dr.

75
00:04:35.761 --> 00:04:37.682
Chilton has to see Pollyanna?"

76
00:04:39.563 --> 00:04:43.245
Aunt Polly was breathing heavily, and Jimmy thought she was about to cry.

77
00:04:48.467 --> 00:04:50.789
Jimmy, you've done an excellent job.

78
00:04:52.269 --> 00:04:56.672
Dr. Warren is upstairs now with Pollyanna, and I need to speak to him right away!"

79
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:01.601
A minute later Dr.

80
00:05:01.641 --> 00:05:04.684
Warren was surprised to meet a flustered Aunt Polly in the hall.

81
00:05:05.845 --> 00:05:08.006
He was even more surprised by what she said.

82
00:05:08.026 --> 00:05:12.510
"Dr. Warren, you once asked me to allow Dr.

83
00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:15.393
Chilton to examine Pollyanna, and I refused."

84
00:05:16.574 --> 00:05:19.036
Miss Polly looked the doctor right in the eye.

85
00:05:19.056 --> 00:05:24.540
"Some new information has made me reconsider that decision.

86
00:05:25.861 --> 00:05:28.664
Please ask him to come as soon as possible!"
